    "title": "Copies that answer reads",
    "body": "With **leader-follower replication**, the **leader** takes every write and sends each change to the **followers**, which apply the same changes in the same order. Followers that also answer reads are **read replicas**. Writes still go only to the leader; reads can go to any replica.",
